-- title:
--   Finite matching-certificate tables
-- statement:
--   The cross and mixed certificate lists are assembled from explicit finite chunks. Each stored certificate carries a permutation, two label indices and integer combination coefficients. The cross data cover permutations of six matching terms and the mixed data cover seven augmented terms. These are concrete data for exhaustive certificate coverage, not a new hypothesis asserting coverage.
